GATE MET. The deep arm is 92.6% (95% CI 76.6-97.9) accurate on the known-answer cases, 
so its verdicts on the other 68 are usable as a reference standard, 
with that error rate carried into every figure drawn from them. 
Deep over light by +11.1 points on the same 27 cases. 

